    {
      "id": "claim_1dcfa749115848259fb856e37ba507a2",
      "statement": "render_line is the hook/CLI entrypoint: it resolves the theme and style via themes::get and styles::get, reads $HOME, detects the timezone offset via clock::detect_tz_offset, supplies the update cache to the shared render_ctx path, and triggers the optional float readout when cfg.thresholds.float is set.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/render/mod.rs#L22-L52",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1f54ef9560a218111a912c5d0c8c04a767b8497627e91171173f11f9555d4077:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_542f700630fd4e91944ed6ec147b1803",
      "statement": "render_with is the lower-level entry that takes already-resolved theme, style, now, home, and tz_offset_seconds directly; the TUI preview and tests call it with deterministic values. Both render_line and render_with funnel into the shared render_ctx, which builds the RenderCtx and dispatches between render_auto and render_fixed based on cfg.thresholds.layout.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/render/mod.rs#L57-L109",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e30b4e80449df4095ba0ab42532d0b24f9362b259c72069fb051e14c6994182e:"
