      "id": "claim_9d8a57bc29ea47eb9ace772df2ceb066",
      "statement": "The composer owns separators: a separator (space + glyph in the theme's separator color + space, or a lone space for the lean empty separator) is placed only between adjacent non-empty segments, and empty segments are dropped with their separators so no dangling separator appears.",
