    {
      "id": "claim_feb56c385525463e985cb61f6d84b4e2",
      "statement": "render_line, when the update-notice segment is enabled, reads the update cache once and calls update::refresh_in_background, which spawns a detached `claudebar update --check` child at most once a day without blocking the render; the cached latest version (kept only when strictly newer than the installed CARGO_PKG_VERSION) is passed into RenderCtx as ctx.update. The update-notice segment is a pure formatter that renders an up-arrow badge only when ctx.update is Some, so segments never touch the network.",
